# Generated test media (rebuild with `make fixtures`)
/tests/fixtures/generated/

# Personal media never belongs in this repository. Every fixture this project
# tests with is generated by `make fixtures`, so the only image committed here is
# the app screenshot the README embeds. Adding a real capture on purpose needs
# `git add -f`, which is the point.
